			"notes": "Features:\n- Token/SSID login\n- Account browser with search, sort, notes, and token refresh (Prism, MultiMC, GDL, .txt)\n- My Accounts screen for prismlauncher saved accounts\n- Proxy browser with rotation on refresh (3 per proxy, auto-failover)\n- Proxy support (SOCKS4/SOCKS5/HTTP)\n- Proxy auto-connect (binds proxy to account)\n- Hypixel Skyblock stats per account (sblvl, coop), sorted by sblvl\n- Hypixel selfban (/skyblock → /hub)\n- Auto-reconnect (1s countdown on disconnect screen)\n- Lobby anonymiser (hides server/lobby codes and profile IDs)\n- Hover loot (shift+drag to mass shift-click inventory slots)\n- Manual refresh tester (test refresh tokens with known client IDs)\n- Nick hider\n- IGN changer"
		},
